    "title": "File creation ownership in iiLocalDiffusion",
    "role": "guide",
    "authority": "markdown_source"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b000001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 1,
      "raw": "# File creation ownership in iiLocalDiffusion\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "File creation ownership in iiLocalDiffusion"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 3,
      "raw": "Native model/cache/telemetry writers and Python image, video, PCM, checkpoint and model-package outputs use provider streams or staging. PNG generation remains PNG; editor IISC persistence is a separate domain operation. Worker scans exclude provider control files and temporary cleanup tolerates moved stages.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 4,
      "end_line": 4,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 5,
      "end_line": 8,
      "raw": "The common [ownership contract](../../iiFileProvider/docs/FILE_OWNERSHIP.md) defines stream, staging, control-file and\ninstalled-package rules. Source regression tests remain with this module; the\nworkspace creation audit also checks these boundaries. Build/deployment and target\nruntime validation are separate evidence.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 9,
      "end_line": 9,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 10,
      "end_line": 13,
      "raw": "Runtime installation includes the provider's Python worker adapter, shared native\nlibrary and license notices. Relocated workers resolve the adjacent SDK library;\nmacOS app workers also resolve the versioned library in `Contents/Frameworks`.\nAn installed product does not require a separate SDK in the user's home directory.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000008",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 14,
      "end_line": 14,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 15,
      "end_line": 15,
      "raw": "Changed boundaries:\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000010",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 16,
      "end_line": 17,
      "raw": "\n\n"
    },
